Islandia runtuh.

206
00:09:23,800 --> 00:09:26,300
Nilai krona anjlok
lebih dari 70%.

207
00:09:26,300 --> 00:09:28,100
Sementara pasar sahamnya

208
00:09:28,100 --> 00:09:30,600
